    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="El. 30">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:Af">Af</ref> El. 30</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">Ða fæmnan þe gewuniað onfón gealdorcræftigan ⁊ scinlæcan ⁊ wiccan, ne læt þu ða libban.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">Those women who are accustomed to receive enchanters and magicians and witches – do not permit them to live.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">Ða fæmnan þe gewilniað onfon gealdercræftigan and scinlacan and wiccan, ne læt þu hi libban.</ab>
      </div>
